1. Everything is an object
At compile time, all constructs are a javascript object, literally
A file is an object of objects // so we don't have to specify module structure
A folder is an object of files (objects) // modules are just nested folders
A type is an object with certain structure // like in zig
A number is an object with certain structure // like in zig
A string!? is an object with this structure: {len: u32, ptr: u32}

2. Foo bar baz

